  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Qin Ding Ling passes Fang Yuan a third rank eight Immortal Gu and names it Heaven Qi Immortal Gu, completing the trio with Human Qi and Earth Qi Immortal Gu used for Triple Qi Retraction. She groups these three as priceless Heavenly Court treasures and the cores of that killer move, limited to members, and hints that joining would make them available. Fang Yuan says this Gu is tightly connected with heaven path, and that his method to remove the qi harvest fruit only succeeded after he grasped a trace of heaven path profundity; with this Gu he would have succeeded much earlier. In his own assessment the three cannot be swapped for other qi path Immortal Gu without collapsing the battle value of Triple Qi Retraction, even with Primordial Origin’s qi path true inheritance already in hand.",
        "chapters": [
          2025
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_qin_ding_ling",
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "sys_immortal_gu",
          "sys_human_qi",
          "gu_earth_qi_immortal_gu",
          "move_triple_qi_retraction",
          "fac_heavenly_court",
          "inh_qi_path_true_inheritance"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Heaven qi as the clear sky-side resource, separate from this Gu, is covered on heaven qi.",
        "chapters": [],
        "certainty": "inferred",
        "confidence": "C",
        "verification": "no_citation",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_heaven_qi"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Qin Ding Ling temporarily lends all three qi Immortal Gu so Fang Yuan, disguised as Qi Sea Ancestor, can familiarize himself with them while setting up the qi path formation against Heavenly Court’s qi harvest fruit. Heaven Qi, Earth Qi, and Human Qi sit as that formation’s core Immortal Gu; Heavenly Court keeps the option to take them back at once and strip him of control.",
        "chapters": [
          2025
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "formation-and-lending",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_qi_sea_ancestor",
          "sys_earth_qi"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After the qi harvest fruit is gone and Qi Sea Ancestor presses for payment while chasing Dragon Palace, Qin Ding Ling agrees to give heaven qi and earth qi Immortal Gu but refuses Human Qi Immortal Gu as Heavenly Court’s bottom line. She keeps Human Qi as bait: with two of the three cores in hand, Triple Qi Retraction still needs the missing Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          2037
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "permanent-transfer",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "house_dragon_palace",
          "gu_human_qi_immortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When Star Constellation Immortal Venerable suppresses Qi Sea Ancestor in Heavenly Court, rank eight Heaven Qi Immortal Gu flies out of his immortal aperture first, then Earth Qi Immortal Gu and other qi path Immortal Gu, held for Primordial Origin Immortal Venerable rather than refined on the spot.",
        "chapters": [
          2327
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "aperture-seizure",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_star_constellation_immortal_venerable",
          "char_primordial_origin_immortal_venerable"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
